   "notes": "This is a guided tour to the draft of my existential risk website and its prototypes (v1 and v3). Site calculates and visualizes the connection between existential risk probability and humankind's longevity over time. \n\nThe aim is not to depict any particular x-risk probabilities, but to offer a flexible platform to try out different values and to show that even seemingly small risks, or small changes in them, have a huge impact over time, due to the permanence of extinction and the vast value of humanity in case we survive. I want this to motivate us to work to reduce these risks. ",
